<title>USA: Manor Care has 51 pct of Vitalink.</title>
<headline>Manor Care has 51 pct of Vitalink.</headline>
<dateline>GAITHERSBURG, Md. 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manor Care Inc said Thursday it had raised its stake in Vitalink Pharmacy Services Inc to about 51 percent with the suxxessful completion of its tender offer for 1.5 million Vitalink shares at $20 each.</p>
<p>Manor Care said the offer was oversubscribed and the preliminary proration factor is about 31 percent.</p>
</text>
